### Test Server is Running
GET http://localhost:5000
Accept: application/json

### Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Create Category (Admin Required)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and gadgets",
  "image": "https://via.placeholder.com/300"
}

### Create Another Category
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Fashion",
  "description": "Clothing and accessories"
}

### Create Subcategory
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Smartphones",
  "description": "Mobile phones and accessories",
  "parent": "PARENT_CATEGORY_ID"
}

### Get Category Tree
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories/tree
Accept: application/json

### Create Product (Seller Required - Use multipart/form-data in Postman)
# Note: For file uploads, use Postman or Thunder Client
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "Latest iPhone with A17 Pro chip, titanium design, and advanced camera system",
  "price": 99999,
  "comparePrice": 109999,
  "category": "CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "brand": "Apple",
  "stock": 50,
  "sku": "IPH15PRO-128-BLK",
  "tags": ["smartphone", "apple", "iphone", "5g"]
}

### Search Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?search=iphone
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=CATEGORY_ID
Accept: application/json

### Filter by Price Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?minPrice=10000&maxPrice=50000
Accept: application/json

### Sort by Price (Low to High)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?sort=price_asc
Accept: application/json

### Sort by Rating
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?sort=rating
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Product
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID_OR_SLUG
Accept: application/json

### Update Product (Seller/Owner)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "title": "iPhone 15 Pro Max",
  "price": 129999,
  "stock": 45
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

### Add Review (Authenticated User)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent product! Highly recommended."
}

### Get Seller Dashboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seller/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

### Get Seller's Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seller/products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

### Get Seller's Products with Filter
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seller/products?status=active&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json
